{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日は乃木のの の公開録音イベントです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回も\nお世話になってる富士急さん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/03/28/6992623/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しみ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アトラクションとか乗れなくても\n遊園地って行けるだけで\n雰囲気がもう楽しい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/03/28/6992623/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"晴れだといいなあ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、雨天決行です"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/03/28/6992623/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあ明日は雨降らなそうだよ！天気予報見てみたけど！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さて、今回は\n公開録音ということなので\n放送ではカットされてしまう可能性もあるので\nここでしか聞けない話も出てくるかもね(ﾟﾛﾟ)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たぶんメンバーの本音が分かる！？\n的な企画らしいのでドキドキ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来てくださったことがあるかたは\nわかるかもしれないけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ステージに近くて見やすいところに\n席があるんだけど\nそこの整理券は"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"朝の9時から園内ステージ前で\n400席分、配られます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/03/28/6992623/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"整理券ゲットできたかたは\n13時から指定席エリア開場になるから\n13時までにきてね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"整理券ゲットできなかったとしても\n立ち見で良ければ見れるので\n是非、来てください"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/03/28/6992623/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回はトークの公開収録のみならず\nミニライブもやっちゃいます！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お楽しみに～！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中田は\n上手も下手もどっちもたぶん\n同じくらいいきますので\n中田推しはどちらでも"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/03/28/6992623/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"盛り上がりましょ〜！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさん\n富士急で好きな乗り物とかありますか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/03/28/6992623/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"埼玉ウォーカーのときのオフショット！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"}